{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"s3tl000000000010","type":"text","text":"**时刻 →**","x":-1990,"y":-1495,"width":340,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000011","type":"text","text":"**t0 复位**\n热 / 温 / 冷复位\n（FLR 不算）","x":-1600,"y":-1495,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000012","type":"text","text":"**t1 物理层通了**\n$LinkUp = 1b$\n软件未 Disable Link","x":-1240,"y":-1495,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000013","type":"text","text":"**t2 特性交换**\n（可选：支持 ∧ Enable=1 才走）","x":-880,"y":-1495,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000014","type":"text","text":"**t3 流控阶段一**\n收全对方 P/NP/Cpl 三类 credit → $FI1$","x":-520,"y":-1495,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000015","type":"text","text":"**t4 流控阶段二**\n收到对方 InitFC2 → $FI2$","x":-160,"y":-1495,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000016","type":"text","text":"**t5 正常工作**\n直到……","x":200,"y":-1495,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000017","type":"text","text":"**t6 链路掉了**\n$LinkUp = 0b$\n（任何状态下都会发生）","x":560,"y":-1495,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000020","type":"text","text":"**DLCMSM Flow**","x":-1990,"y":-1280,"width":340,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000021","type":"text","text":"**DL_Inactive**\n复位全部状态\n**清空 Retry Buffer**","x":-1600,"y":-1280,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000022","type":"text","text":"**DL_Inactive**\n（判断往哪走）","x":-1240,"y":-1060,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000023","type":"text","text":"**DL_Feature**\n（不支持/未使能则跳过）","x":-880,"y":-1280,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000024","type":"text","text":"**DL_Init**\n子状态 $FC\\_INIT1$","x":-520,"y":-1060,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000025","type":"text","text":"**DL_Init**\n子状态 $FC\\_INIT2$","x":-160,"y":-1280,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000026","type":"text","text":"**DL_Active**","x":200,"y":-1060,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000027","type":"text","text":"**→ DL_Inactive**\n回到 t0 的状态","x":560,"y":-1280,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000030","type":"text","text":"**状态输出**\n（给事务层看）","x":-1990,"y":-800,"width":340,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000031","type":"text","text":"$DL\\_Down$","x":-1600,"y":-800,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000032","type":"text","text":"$DL\\_Down$","x":-1240,"y":-800,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000033","type":"text","text":"$DL\\_Down$","x":-880,"y":-800,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000034","type":"text","text":"$DL\\_Down$","x":-520,"y":-800,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000035","type":"text","text":"⭐ **$DL\\_Up$**\n比 DL_Active 早一步","x":-160,"y":-800,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000036","type":"text","text":"$DL\\_Up$","x":200,"y":-800,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000037","type":"text","text":"$DL\\_Down$\nDownstream = 热拔出\nUpstream = 热复位","x":560,"y":-800,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000080","type":"text","text":"⭐ **DL_Up 在 t4 就拉高了，比 DL_Active 早一步**\nspec：*Report DL_Down status while in state FC_INIT1; DL_Up status in state FC_INIT2*\nDL_Up 的定义是「is **communicating** with the other side」—— 能进 FC_INIT2 说明已收到对方的 InitFC1，对话确实通了。\n**「能对话」≠「能发 TLP」**，后者要等 DL_Active + 有 credit。","x":960,"y":-755,"width":880,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000082","type":"text","text":"⭐ **t0 / t6 清空 Retry Buffer = 真的丢数据**\n进 DL_Inactive 时 Retry Buffer 被清空，里面「已发未确认」的 TLP 永久放弃。**DLL 的可靠性只在链路活着时成立。**\n对比 S8：REPLAY_NUM 溢出触发重训练时 Retry Buffer **不清空** —— 重训练是修链路，不丢数据。","x":960,"y":-1145,"width":880,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000047","type":"text","text":"❌\n未决事务全部丢弃","x":560,"y":-630,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000042","type":"text","text":"❌","x":-1240,"y":-630,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000043","type":"text","text":"❌\n事务层**必须阻塞** TLP","x":-880,"y":-630,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000044","type":"text","text":"❌\n阻塞 **VC0** 的 TLP","x":-520,"y":-630,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000045","type":"text","text":"❌\n仍阻塞 VC0 的 TLP\n（DL_Up ≠ 能发）","x":-160,"y":-630,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000046","type":"text","text":"✅\n有 credit 就能发","x":200,"y":-630,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000040","type":"text","text":"**事务层能发 TLP 吗**","x":-1990,"y":-630,"width":340,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000041","type":"text","text":"❌\n未决事务全部丢弃","x":-1600,"y":-630,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000067","type":"text","text":"不产生也不接受","x":560,"y":-180,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000062","type":"text","text":"不产生也不接受","x":-1240,"y":-180,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000063","type":"text","text":"**Data Link Feature DLLP**\n≥ 每 34 µs 一次","x":-880,"y":-180,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000064","type":"text","text":"**InitFC1**-P/NP/Cpl\n≥ 每 34 µs 一轮","x":-520,"y":-180,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000065","type":"text","text":"**InitFC2**-P/NP/Cpl\n≥ 每 34 µs 一轮","x":-160,"y":-180,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000066","type":"text","text":"全部：Ack/Nak · UpdateFC · PM …","x":200,"y":-180,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000060","type":"text","text":"**DLLP 收发什么**","x":-1990,"y":-180,"width":340,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000061","type":"text","text":"**不产生也不接受**任何 DLLP","x":-1600,"y":-180,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000073","type":"text","text":"§3.3 → [[01_34_S4_数据链路特性交换|S4]]","x":-880,"y":-60,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000074","type":"text","text":"§3.4.1 → [[01_35_S5_流控初始化|S5]]","x":-520,"y":-60,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000075","type":"text","text":"§3.4.1 → [[01_35_S5_流控初始化|S5]]","x":-160,"y":-60,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000070","type":"text","text":"**这一步的依据**","x":-1990,"y":-60,"width":340,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000071","type":"text","text":"§3.2.1 DL_Inactive","x":-1600,"y":-60,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000072","type":"text","text":"§3.2.1 退出条件 A∧B∧(C∧D / ¬C / C∧¬D)","x":-1240,"y":-60,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000076","type":"text","text":"§3.5 / §3.6 → S7–S10","x":200,"y":-60,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000077","type":"text","text":"§3.2.1 Surprise Down（见下）","x":560,"y":-60,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000054","type":"text","text":"**允许丢弃，但不许 Ack**","x":-520,"y":-320,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000057","type":"text","text":"丢弃","x":560,"y":-320,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000055","type":"text","text":"**允许丢弃，但不许 Ack**\n⚠️ 但「收到 TLP」本身会置 $FI2$（S5）","x":-160,"y":-320,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000056","type":"text","text":"6 步检查 → 上交 / Ack / Nak\n（§3.6.3，S10）","x":200,"y":-320,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000052","type":"text","text":"丢弃","x":-1240,"y":-320,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000053","type":"text","text":"**允许丢弃，但不许 Ack**\n（责任留在对方 Retry Buffer 里）","x":-880,"y":-320,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000050","type":"text","text":"**收到对方的 TLP 怎么办**","x":-1990,"y":-320,"width":340,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000051","type":"text","text":"丢弃","x":-1600,"y":-320,"width":320,"height":90},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000081","type":"text","text":"⭐ **t2–t4 的「允许丢弃但不许 Ack」**\n我还没准备好，扔掉可以，**但绝不能骗对方说收到了**。不 Ack → 对方 REPLAY_TIMER 超时 → 自动重发 → 等我准备好了就能正确收下。\n**这是 §3.6 的重传机制在 §3.2 里的一次借用。**\n为什么这时会收到 TLP？因为两端进度不同步，对方可能早进 DL_Active 了。","x":960,"y":-320,"width":880,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000090","type":"text","text":"### t6 的特殊情况：Surprise Down（只对 Downstream Port）\n从 DL_Active 掉到 DL_Inactive，且没人要求 → **Surprise Down 错误**（reported error，若实现了该能力）。\n**6 种「有人主动造成」的掉线被屏蔽**：Secondary Bus Reset · Link Disable · 上游事件传播 · 发过 PME_Turn_Off · Hot-Plug Surprise 槽位 · 软件断电\n屏蔽一直挂着，直到链路**干净地**重新回到 DL_Active。**一个根因只报一次。**","x":-140,"y":220,"width":1400,"height":160},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000091","type":"text","text":"### 为什么顺序不能颠倒\n§3.3 先协商 Scaled FC → 决定 §3.4 InitFC 里 Scale 字段怎么填\n§3.4 先知道对方缓冲多大 → 才能发 TLP 不溢出\n§3.6 有了 TLP → Ack/Nak 才有意义\n**一条严格的依赖链。**","x":-1650,"y":140,"width":630,"height":160},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000001","type":"text","text":"**本板配色**\n- 紫：DLCMSM 状态\n- 黄：状态输出（DL_Down / DL_Up）\n- 绿：允许 / 正常\n- 红：结论 / 陷阱\n- 无色：说明","x":-1990,"y":-1880,"width":620,"height":240},
		{"id":"s3tl000000000000","type":"text","text":"# S3 · 一次开机的时间线\n组库那张看板是**状态机视角**（转移条件）。这张是**时间线视角**：从左到右走一遍开机，每一列是一个时刻，每一行回答一个问题。\n**读法：先横着看一行，再竖着看一列。**","x":-1310,"y":-1880,"width":1000,"height":240}
	],
